WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.350
Lab 2 moves to a test tenant and
a test domain, never production.

2
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:08.932
You create two deliberate orphans, an
app with no owners and a service account

3
00:00:08.932 --> 00:00:13.300
with no application owner, and run the
check with a single read permission.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.488
Both should show up.

5
00:00:14.488 --> 00:00:17.704
Then you do what the governance
officer would: confirm them,

6
00:00:17.704 --> 00:00:20.263
and have a second person
approve the plan's hash.

7
00:00:20.263 --> 00:00:24.275
Only then do you sign in as
a person, dry-run, and apply.

8
00:00:24.275 --> 00:00:27.236
The admin center shows
the app as deactivated,

9
00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:30.275
the account is disabled,
and you record the date.

10
00:00:30.275 --> 00:00:32.420
Then put everything back the way it was.
